{"sourceUrl":"https://vet.lzu.edu.cn/tongzhigonggao/2026/0908/336806.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:45.587777+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://vet.lzu.edu.cn/tongzhigonggao/2026/0908/336806.html","html":"<div>\n<h3>动物医学与生物安全学院2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取实施细则</h3>\n<div>发布时间：2026-09-08   字体大小<span title=\"\">T</span>|<span title=\"\">T</span> </div>\n<div>\n<h1><span><span><span><span>    根据兰州大学《关于做好</span>2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作的通知》等文件精神，结合我院研究生人才培养实际情况，制定《动物医学与生物安全学院2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作细则》（以下简称“推免工作细则”）。</span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>一、组织领导</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院研究生招生工作领导小组全面负责本院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>二、接收推免生专业</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>接收推免硕士生专业：生物安全、生物与医药、免疫学、病原生物学</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>接收推免直博生专业：生物安全、生物与医药、基础医学</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>三、接收条件</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（一）具有推荐免试授权高校的应届本科毕业生</span><span>,并获得所在学校的推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（二）德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，遵纪守法，诚实守信，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（三）在校期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有良好的培养潜质。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（四）无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>申请直接攻读博士学位的推免生（以下简称</span><span>“直博生”），须具有较强的科研创新能力，其全国大学英语六级考试成绩达到425分或雅思6.0分、托福旧版90分(新版4.5分)或具有其他同等水平外语证明，并有所报考学科专业领域内两名教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）的书面推荐意见。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>四、综合考核</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>综合考核包括材料审核、面试、思想政治素质和品德考核。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.材料审核：报考学院的推免生须在兰州大学研究生推免生系统（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>https://yjszs.lzu.edu.cn/lzuyjsytms/wlogin.html</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）提交个人基本信息</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>相关申请材料（材料可包括申请攻读研究生报告及本科成绩单、外语水平证明、科研创新证明、重要奖项证书等支撑材料）和本人签名的诚信承诺书（附件</span><span>1）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>,材料按顺序合并成一个文档后上传</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>(前期已经提交预报名信息但申请材料不全的，可在学院审核前重新提交并保存。已审核通过的无需再次提交)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学院成立材料审核专家组，每组不少于</span><span>3人，对推免生申请材料进行客观独立打分。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.面试考核：通过线上视频会议的方式组织考核，并做好复试记录。学院成立面试专家组，每组一般不少于5人，对推免生的外国语口语及听力测试、专</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>业综合知识考试成绩进行考核。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.思想政治素质和品德考核：推免生（直博生）须填写《复试考生思想政治素质和品德考核情况表》（见附件2），面试小组对考生的思想政治素质和品德进行考核。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.成绩计算</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>综合考核成绩</span><span>=专业综合知识考试成绩×80%+外国口语及听力成绩×20%。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>五、录取</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据推免生（直博生）的复试成绩、申请材料评价成绩、思想品德考核等结果，学院研究生招生工作领导小组提出拟录取名单，并及时报送研究生院审核。有关要求如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.复试成绩不及格或不参加复试者，不予录取；思想政治素质和品德考核不合格者，不予录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.对未能达到直博生录取要求，但符合兰州大学硕士推免生录取要求者，在学院和本人同意的情况下可转报硕士推免生并予以录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.所有录取的直博生均须确定指导教师。接收直博生的导师须符合学院和学校相关要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.学院对录取的推免生（直博生）公示。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>动物医学与生物安全学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>                                                                                                                   2026年9月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vet.lzu.edu.cn/dongwuyixue/upload/files/20260908/d646129aa7114ffb8b9cfc1f2b887da0.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span><span>附件</span><span>1：兰州大学研究生诚信应试承诺书</span></span></span></span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vet.lzu.edu.cn/dongwuyixue/upload/files/20260908/ded1c99f7d264d4581889e336c6b8de9.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span><span>附件</span><span>2：复试考生思想政治素质和品德考核情况表</span></span></span></span></span></span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<strong>上一篇：</strong><a href=\"https://vet.lzu.edu.cn/tongzhigonggao/2026/0909/336873.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2026年度动物疫病防控全国重点实验室（兰州大学）自主课题申报通知</a> <br/>\n<strong>下一篇：</strong><a href=\"https://vet.lzu.edu.cn/tongzhigonggao/2026/0906/336665.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">动物医学与生物安全学院推荐2027届优秀本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作办法</a>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"015ecdb1152f7375f55973734e98204cb7b3a62882725d3692f6c71cf9bb8c65","textLength":1434,"sourceSha256":"6d6182d8a99dd227a5da6e16dee1273f2a9cfdc8947daba7b944e7a4e2898b14","selector":"article-like:article","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3ba16798c61cd2b0645a","title":"2026年兰州大学动物医学与生物安全学院2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:45.587777+00:00"}
